# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). Used by `wrangler dev` and, as a fallback, by `npm run eval`.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Shared secret the app sends as x-app-key. Any long random string.
APP_KEY=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
# Only for testing a purchase made through Xcode's local StoreKit configuration. Xcode signs those
# transactions with a certificate authority it generates per machine, so the Worker has to pin that root
# instead of Apple's or nothing bought in the simulator will verify. Leave it unset to pin Apple's root,
# which is what production does — the two are mutually exclusive.
# Get it from Xcode: open RecipeBasket.storekit, Editor ▸ Save Public Certificate, then
#   openssl x509 -in StoreKitTestCertificate.cer -inform der -noout -fingerprint -sha256
# XCODE_ROOT_FINGERPRINT=AA:BB:CC:...
